* Thévenin, example 2: only a dependent source, 1 A test current
* From the Solved Circuits video "Thévenin Equivalent with Dependent Sources: 3 Solved Examples", https://youtu.be/Ttx-AeMLwVc (CC BY 4.0)
It 0 a 1
Vsense a a1 0
R1 a1 n1 2
R2 n1 0 4
F1 0 n1 Vsense 2
.op
